  "description": "After his career as a pro baseball coach ends in disgrace, Jung Min-Yong comes to Dongcheon High School to whip the baseball team into shape. With his no-nonsense teaching style, the players are pushed to their limits, and when a gifted newbie is recruited to the team, the existing players are forced to face just how much they still have to learn. With Coach Jung laying down one reality check after another, will the players call it quits? Or will it be enough motivation to let their gifts shine?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
